  "compatibility": "Native evaluate_nhalo_inverse bilinearly interpolates stored double ratios. sample_dndM_inverse clips, multiplies by the condition mass, and stoc_mass_sample sums the result in double before comparing the accumulated mass against the stopping threshold. Agreement at table float32, or matching catalog count, therefore cannot certify the draw sequence. A portable bound covering the native CDF residual sign and interpolation/draw decision, or exact native arithmetic for those decisions, is required before enabling a faster inverse backend."
